  "description": "Faster, more versatile, and even better value, the new SLR is aero-optimised to be breakaway-fast and ultra-distance comfortable. Summer through winter, ride or race, the SLR is the perfect option for those looking for one performance bike to ride week in, week out, year-round.\n\nFAST\n\nThe new SLR not only aerodynamically surpasses its predecessor, helping you go faster and further for the same effort, but also retains the comfort, control, and engaging handling characteristics that made the previous SLR a popular choice for many riders.\n\nVERSATILE\n\nThe frame features additional bottle cage mounting points, which enhance its carrying capacity. It also includes concealed mudguard mounts on both the frame and fork. When paired with the dedicated Fend-Off guards designed specifically for the SLR, switching to a wet-weather setup becomes simple and hassle-free.\n\nPRACTICAL\n\nFuture-proofed with added peace of mind. All SLR frames take advantage of the Universal Derailleur Hanger system; this inclusion improves shift performance and makes sourcing a replacement hanger straightforward. In addition, the SLR range, as with all other Boardman models post-2018, is covered by a full lifetime warranty for the original owner.\n\nHIGHLIGHTS\n\n10-Speed Shimano Tiagra Groupset\nShimano Hydraulic Disc Brakes\nCompact 50/34 Chainset with 11-34 Cassette\n30mm Goodyear Eagle Sport, Tubeless Compatible Tyres\nHidden mudguard mounts and additional carrying capacity make the SLR usable all year round.",
